         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Drawing with Multiplication\n\nMultiplication is not only for working with numbers: it is all around us in the real world! When we count the tiles on a floor, the windows of a building, or the beats of a song, we repeat the same quantity many times—we are multiplying.\n\nBut there is an even more beautiful secret: we can **draw** with the results of a multiplication! When we mark the numbers on paper and connect them, straight lines and other shapes appear.\n\nIn this class, we will start drawing with the results of the multiplication table of zero. Let us discover which shape is hiding inside it!",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
