         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### A Rule for Multiplication\n\nWhen we have situations in which an action repeats many times, like multiplication, we can write a **rule** (a law) for it. The rule of multiplication is:\n\n**R = a × N**\n\nWhere:\n- **R** is the **Result** of the multiplication.\n- **a** is the number we are multiplying (the number that is repeated).\n- **N** is the **Number of times** we repeat it.\n\nLet us use this rule to build the multiplication table of zero!",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "c601f869-fa3b-4bcc-a247-10f4d7aa07ae",
