         "source_menu": [],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Let's Think!\n\nAll the dots of the table of zero are on the same horizontal line—at the value zero.\nIf we connect the neighboring dots with straight strokes, will our drawing be a **straight, flat line**?",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "53a6fc0f-5cfa-464e-9e91-4697760e77de",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": "yes",
         "score": 2,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "53a6fc0f-5cfa-464e-9e91-4697760e77de",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "happy",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "b77ec8fc-c988-45f3-82f8-03b136bf1aa9",
               "text": "Chart JS",
               "page": "https://www.chartjs.org/",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2025",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            },
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "a648cecf-238e-4294-a012-3830ff833d67",
               "text": "Original Text",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=a648cecf-238e-4294-a012-3830ff833d67",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Yes! A Straight, Flat Line\n\nExactly! When we connect all the dots with straight strokes, our drawing becomes a **straight line** that is perfectly **flat**—since every result is zero, the line never goes up or down: it stays exactly on the horizontal line:",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 190\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;max-width:500px\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"520\" height=\"190\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><defs><marker id=\"arrowH\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"5\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z\" fill=\"#333333\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"32\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"450\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowH)\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"80\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"120\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"160\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"360\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"400\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"440\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#555555\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#555555\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#555555\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#555555\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#555555\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#555555\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><text x=\"280\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#555555\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#555555\" text-anchor=\"middle\">7</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#555555\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#555555\" text-anchor=\"middle\">9</text><text x=\"440\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#555555\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10</text><text x=\"468\" y=\"106\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#333333\">N</text><polyline points=\"40,110 80,110 120,110 160,110 200,110 240,110 280,110 320,110 360,110 400,110 440,110\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#E74C3C\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"110\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#E74C3C\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"110\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#E74C3C\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"110\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#E74C3C\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"110\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#E74C3C\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"110\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#E74C3C\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"110\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#E74C3C\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"110\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#E74C3C\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"110\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#E74C3C\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"360\" cy=\"110\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#E74C3C\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"110\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#E74C3C\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"440\" cy=\"110\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#E74C3C\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg></p>",
